  "version": "1.6.0",
  "changelog": "Repointed to the game's actual building files in adamsville-play: per-zone converted buildings.json + buildings_detail.json + buildings.js twin, downloaded on open via the Contents API. Full round-trip save (local save -> push -> close connection -> fresh connection -> re-download proof copy -> refresh view) with stage-accurate failure messages; only dirty zones are pushed. 1,532 conversion-flagged buildings are displayed FLAGGED and locked against move/resize/delete pending Joshua's decision. Hero buildings (535 Dollar Mill) are listed per zone, read-only. Subdivisions persist to editors/building-editor/subdivisions.json in this repo, and Generate Houses now bakes houses into the zone building files. New modules: zonedata.py, flagged_buildings.json.",
